        "answer": {
          "short": "$3^4\\times4^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3^2\\times4^2\\times3^2&=3^2\\times3^2\\times4^2\\\\3^2\\times4^2\\times3^2&=3^{2+2}\\times4^2\\\\3^2\\times4^2\\times3^2&=3^4\\times4^2\\end{align*}$$\nCombine the powers of 3; the power of 4 has a different base.",
